WEBVTT

00:06:29.593 --> 00:06:30.970
it’ll actually orbit Jupiter

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.847
and it’ll do flybys of Europa

00:06:32.847 --> 00:06:35.433
and remotely measure
the Moon and its ocean.

00:06:36.434 --> 00:06:37.518
But how about this?

00:06:38.102 --> 00:06:41.772
So I envision a future
where to study Europa’s ocean,

00:06:41.772 --> 00:06:44.859
we send submarines
down into the ocean itself.

00:06:45.317 --> 00:06:48.070
And we study the ocean
from within the ocean,

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:50.322
and we directly search for signs of life.

00:06:50.865 --> 00:06:51.991
And while we’re at it,

00:06:51.991 --> 00:06:54.535
we should also send 
submersibles to Enceladus.

00:06:55.119 --> 00:06:56.912
Enceladus is a moon of Saturn.

00:06:57.371 --> 00:06:58.414
It’s amazing.

00:06:58.664 --> 00:07:00.374
It also has a subsurface --